{"id":"417cabd731eca511","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof.md","title":"真理陈述者反驳极小间隙推出全固定点间隙","display":"lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof — 真理陈述者反驳极小间隙推出全固定点间隙","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof","aliases":["91-lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof","91-lem-gap-stable-proof","91-lem-gap-proof"],"display":"lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof — 真理陈述者反驳极小间隙推出全固定点间隙","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-teller-semantic]]","[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]","[[91-df-gap-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof</span><span>91-lem-gap-stable-proof</span><span>91-lem-gap-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof — 真理陈述者反驳极小间隙推出全固定点间隙"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e63bca271dfc8f1\" href=\"?note=8e63bca271dfc8f1\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller-semantic\">91-df-truth-teller-semantic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8747011468390705\" href=\"?note=8747011468390705\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-gap\">91-df-truth-value-gap</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"10229cf1ace7edd3\" href=\"?note=10229cf1ace7edd3\" title=\"91-df-gap-sentence\">91-df-gap-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"10229cf1ace7edd3\" href=\"?note=10229cf1ace7edd3\" title=\"91-df-gap-sentence\">91-df-gap-sentence</a> 的极小固定点间隙集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=T(t)\">\\(\\tau=T(t)\\)</span> 为闭项直接自指真理陈述者；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TellSem}_J(\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TellSem}_J(\\tau)\\)</span> 的极小间隙和两种闭包模型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8e63bca271dfc8f1\" href=\"?note=8e63bca271dfc8f1\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller-semantic\">91-df-truth-teller-semantic</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\)</span> 为一致固定点类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StableGap}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathrm{StableGap}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}stability\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\quad\nv_{X_{\\min}}(\\tau)=\\mathbf u\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\exists X_+,X_-\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\n[\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner\\in X_+\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\tau\\urcorner\\in X_-].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}stability\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\quad\nv_{X_{\\min}}(\\tau)=\\mathbf u\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\exists X_+,X_-\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\n[\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner\\in X_+\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\tau\\urcorner\\in X_-].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\quad\\land\\quad\\neg\\mathrm{StableGap}(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\quad\\land\\quad\\neg\\mathrm{StableGap}(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对从空集开始的每个阶段，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 首次加入需要它在前一阶段已加入；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\tau\">\\(\\neg\\tau\\)</span> 首次加入，亦需相应负信息。故最小闭包两者皆无。\n以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner\\}\">\\(\\{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\ulcorner\\neg\\tau\\urcorner\\}\">\\(\\{\\ulcorner\\neg\\tau\\urcorner\\}\\)</span> 分别作一致的后固定点种子并超限闭包，得到两个不同固定点。种子不是最终固定点。\n旧断言写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in X\">\\(\\tau\\in X\\)</span> 混淆句子与句子编码，现改为编码成员关系；需要的自指也是实际闭项句，而非仅 PA 可证的任意双条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 15.7 的真理陈述者构造，印刷页 191，PDF 页 202。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-teller-semantic","status":"resolved","id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller-semantic]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-gap","status":"resolved","id":"8747011468390705","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-gap-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"10229cf1ace7edd3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-gap-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-gap-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"10229cf1ace7edd3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}$ 为 [[91-df-gap-sentence]] 的极小固定点间隙集。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-teller-semantic","status":"resolved","id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau=T(t)$ 为闭项直接自指真理陈述者；$\\operatorname{TellSem}_J(\\tau)$ 的极小间隙和两种闭包模型见 [[91-df-truth-teller-semantic]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau=T(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TellSem}_J(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StableGap}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}stability\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\quad\nv_{X_{\\min}}(\\tau)=\\mathbf u\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\exists X_+,X_-\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\n[\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner\\in X_+\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\tau\\urcorner\\in X_-].","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\quad\\land\\quad\\neg\\mathrm{StableGap}(\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\ulcorner\\neg\\tau\\urcorner\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in X","display":false}],"bytes":1963,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-gap-sentence-stability-proof]]"}],"outgoing":["8e63bca271dfc8f1","3a19d5715745463a","8747011468390705","10229cf1ace7edd3"]}